1228..1287 Comment "/// A semigroup\'s one law: associativity overlaps itself at"
1288..1361 Comment "/// `mul(mul(mul(a, b), c), d)`, and both ways round reach `mul(a, mul(b,"
1362..1436 Comment "/// mul(c, d)))`. The rewrite at the peak matches the rule\'s `z` against a"
1437..1507 Comment "/// subterm holding the peak\'s own `z`, which stays the peak\'s (#654)."
